<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A5.F5.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="A5.F5.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Attention-head sparsity (layer<math id="A5.F5.sf2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math>head).</span></figcaption>
